      "widgets_values": [
        "去掉方言口音，转换成标准普通话  - Remove the regional accent and convert to standard Mandarin.\n\n\n请去掉这段语音里的方言口音，保持说话人音色一致。\nWhatever you typed into Primary Content was ignored, and the Chinese instruction was always dispatched to the Qwen text encoder even when processing English audio.\n\n3. Update Applied to Comfyui-Auk-T8\nWe updated \n\ntask_templates.py\n to support the official dual-language templates from Tencent's official AuK Cookbook:\n\nWhen English text is entered (e.g. \"Remove regional accent, convert to standard pronunciation\"): It now emits the official AuK English instruction:\ntext\nRemove the regional accent while preserving the speaker's voice and content.\nWhen Chinese text is entered (or default): It emits:\ntext\n请去掉这段语音里的方言口音，保持说话人音色一致。\n"
      ],
